{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他忽然不再绷着，胸口打开，身体轻得像失了重量；心事仍未解决。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S09\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M43\", \"M36\", \"M42\", \"M1\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他已碰到，回想不能把刚才的欢喜带回此刻，继续绷紧也改不了它已过去。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S09\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M43\", \"M36\", \"M42\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"松开之后，他发现那阵欢喜虽不能重来，心里留下的温柔却没有消失。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S08\", \"S09\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M8\", \"M12\", \"M42\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"那阵欢喜曾真实地充实过他；如今不能重现，并不能反过来抹掉它。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S08\", \"S09\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M8\", \"M42\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，欢喜不能重来，却仍能留下温柔；不必重演那一刻，才能承认它真实发生过。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8bf04a28-4ee7-456f-a947-cdafa8095577", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T235922753990Z", "elapsed_seconds": 163.5, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T00:02:06.263391+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "62e071c90dde0ce962b1822c4970fac53dbfe06d5e7e25f927e504